msgstr "0 = legélesebb · 20 = leglágyabb"

#: bigame-engine/bigame-core/src/benchmark/mod.rs:375
msgid "1% low"
msgstr "1% low"

#: bigame-engine/bigame-core/src/health.rs:867
#: bigame-engine/bigame-core/src/health.rs:870
msgid "32-bit Vulkan"
msgstr "32 bites Vulkan"

#: bigame-engine/bigame-core/src/graphics/diagnose.rs:83
